ed statistics. Those deemed inadequate in these areas may be required to take a set of remedial courses prescribed by the Department's postgraduate committee and obtain at least a grade B in these courses.\nFor enquiries on our program, please email pgieda@ust.hk. For other admission-related enquiries, please contact Office of Postgraduate Studies.\nUseful Links:\nHow to Apply\nAdmission Requirements\nAdmission Timeline\nOnline Application\nAdmission-related Enquiries\nAbout\nMessage from the Head\nAbout IEDA\nMission and Vision\nAwards, Honors & Achievements\nQuality Assurance\nPeople\nFaculty\nStaff\nPostgraduates\nAdvisory Board\nAcademics\nUndergraduate Programs\nOverview\nBEng in Decision Analytics\nBEng in Industrial Engineering and Engineering Management\nDual Degree Program\nMinor Programs\nAdmissions\nAdmission Scholarship\nEnrichment\nResearch Postgraduate Programs\nOverview\nPhD in IEDA\nMPhil in IEDA\nCareer Prospects\nAdmissions\nFinancial Assistance\nHong Kong PhD Fellowship\nAcademic Writing Resources\nSummer Research Program 2025\nTaught Postgraduate Program\nTeaching Innovation\nResearch\nResearch Areas\nLaboratories\nProject Highlights\nNews Center\nNews\nEvents\nPublications\nPhoto Gallery\nVideo Gallery\nAlumni & Careers\nOur Stories\nIEDA Careers\nPrivacy\nSitemap\nContact Us\nCopyright \u00a9 The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology. All rights reserved.\nFollow us on\nPrivacy\nSitemap\nContact Us\nFollow us on\nCopyright \u00a9 The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology.\nAll rights reserved.", "links": [["University News", "https://www.ust.hk/news"], ["Academic Departments A-Z", "https://www.ust.hk/academics/list"], ["Life@HKUST", "https://www.ust.hk/lifehkust"], ["Library", "http://library.ust.hk/"], ["Map & Directions", "https://www.ust.hk/map-directions"], ["Jobs@HKUST", "https://www.ab.ust.hk/hro/PubDoc/careers/main.html?btn1=btn_nav_06&main=welcome.html"], ["Faculty Profiles", "https://facultyprofiles.ust.hk/"], ["About